    <ns0:title>v0.40.16-rc0: Add ripple preview support to the MLX runner (#19592)</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Add the Ripple model, renderer, parser and import registration.&lt;br&gt;
Support per-layer NoPE in DFlash drafts.&lt;br&gt;
Fuse MLP activation, value blending and attention gating.&lt;br&gt;
Add reference fixtures and model/runner regression tests.&lt;/p&gt;</ns0:content>
