    <ns0:title>v0.40.14</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch claude&lt;/code&gt; now applies the model's output token limit for Claude Code, so cloud models no longer run into the 128k default cap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud web search responses on &lt;code&gt;/api/chat&lt;/code&gt; are now decoded correctly, including compressed responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenAI-compatible endpoints no longer override a model's packaged sampler defaults — cli</ns0:content>
