    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;LFM3 on Linux and Windows&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liquid AI's &lt;a href="https://ollama.com/library/lfm3" rel="nofollow"&gt;LFM3&lt;/a&gt; models, including text-to-speech in &lt;a href="https://ollama.com/library/lfm3-audio" rel="nofollow"&gt;lfm3-audio&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://ollama.com/library/lfm3-omni" rel="nofollow"&gt;lfm3-omni&lt;/a&gt;, now run on Linux and Windows as well as Apple silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
